{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mise-action/releases/429855428","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mise-action/releases/429855428/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/jdx/mise-action/releases/429855428/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/jdx/mise-action/releases/tag/v5.2.5","id":429855428,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOLAFUFM4ZnxLE","tag_name":"v5.2.5","target_commitish":"main","name":"v5.2.5: Bundled packslip verifier updated to 1.11.0; README examples use v5","draft":false,"immutable":true,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-10-31T10:03:40Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T10:05:00Z","published_at":"2026-10-31T10:04:11Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mise-action/tarball/v5.2.5","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mise-action/zipball/v5.2.5","body":"This release updates the packslip library that the action uses to verify downloaded mise releases, and updates the README examples to use the current major versions.\n\n## Changed\n\n- **packslip updated from 1.8.0 to 1.11.0.** The action uses packslip to check a downloaded mise binary against the signed `packslip.sigstore.json` that ships with mise releases from 2026.9.3 onward. The new version runs extra checks on the signed statement: the identity it declares must match the certificate that signed it, and the certificate must belong to the `github.com/jdx/mise` repository. GitHub and GitLab repository names now match regardless of letter case. The action still asks for the same identity, issuer and tag as before, and there are no new inputs. ([#715](https://github.com/jdx/mise-action/pull/715))\n- The README examples now use `jdx/mise-action@v5` and `actions/checkout@v7`. ([#710](https://github.com/jdx/mise-action/pull/710) by @deining)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/jdx/mise-action/compare/v5.2.4...v5.2.5","mentions_count":1}